WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:06.400
If there remained any lingering optimism that&nbsp;
the world is too interconnected for large,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:13.680
Capitalist nations to go to war, February&nbsp;
24th, 2022 was the final nail in the coffin.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:19.600
The Russian invasion of Ukraine is far&nbsp;
from the first armed conflict this century.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:23.440
Nor is it even the first initiated by Russia.

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:27.840
But in its scale and proximity&nbsp;
to the European continent,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:30.880
it’s perhaps the most symbolically significant.

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:38.160
Clearly, the Golden Arches Theory of history&nbsp;
— which suggests no two countries home to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:41.600
a McDonald’s franchise will&nbsp;
fight one another — fails to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:45.600
capture the senseless violence some&nbsp;
leaders are capable of inflicting.

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:50.720
But although we aren’t living in the&nbsp;
“End of History”, neither could any&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:56.000
simple economic model predict the scale or&nbsp;
speed of the corporate exodus from Russia.

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:01.920
The same companies which lend only lip&nbsp;
service to climate change — many of which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:08.320
had not millions but billions invested in&nbsp;
the country — simply packed up and left,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.320 --> 00:01:10.480
and all in the span of a few weeks.

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:17.520
When McDonald’s announced its complete exit from&nbsp;
the Russian market 81 days after the war began,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:19.600
we learned another important lesson…

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:26.560
Not only is globalization not inevitable,&nbsp;
but it can all unravel in an instant.

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:32.480
And you can bet that if these largely&nbsp;
self-imposed corporate sanctions surprised&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:37.360
us, they absolutely shocked China,&nbsp;
where everything is pure business.

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:46.080
Everyone, everywhere is now quietly wondering:&nbsp;
If Russia, the world’s 11th largest economy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:51.040
could be effectively isolated overnight,&nbsp;
could the same thing happen to China?

